<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Hormuz Shock</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

:root{
    --bg:#071629;
    --panel:#0f223f;
    --panel-border:#1f3a61;
    --text:#eef3ff;
    --muted:#9aa8c7;
    --red:#ff6359;
    --orange:#ffb322;
    --purple:#9b7bff;
}

*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#031224,#071629);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:Inter,sans-serif;
    padding:30px;
}

.container{
    max-width:1600px;
    margin:auto;
}

/* HEADER */

.hero{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:flex-start;
    gap:30px;
}

h1{
    font-size:68px;
    font-weight:900;
    line-height:1;
}

h1 span{
    color:var(--red);
}

.subtitle{
    margin-top:14px;
    max-width:1000px;
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:28px;
    line-height:1.5;
}

.status{
    border:1px solid var(--panel-border);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);
    border-radius:20px;
    padding:18px 22px;
    min-width:350px;
}

.status-title{
    font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;
    font-size:24px;
}

.status-dot{
    width:14px;
    height:14px;
    display:inline-block;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--red);
    margin-right:10px;
}

/* TIMELINE */

.timeline{
    position:relative;
    margin:60px 0;
    height:140px;
}

.timeline-line{
    height:2px;
    background:#38506e;
    position:absolute;
    width:100%;
    top:50px;
}

.event{
    position:absolute;
    top:18px;
    text-align:center;
    font-size:14px;
    color:#d5def4;
}

.dot{
    width:14px;
    height:14px;
    border-radius:50%;
    margin:auto;
    margin-bottom:16px;
}

.red{background:#ff6359;}
.orange{background:#ffb322;}
.cyan{background:#3fd4d4;}
.purple{background:#9b7bff;}

/* TABS */

.tabs{
    display:flex;
    gap:40px;
    margin-bottom:40px;
}

.tab{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:18px;
    font-weight:700;
    padding-bottom:15px;
}

.tab.active{
    color:white;
    border-bottom:4px solid var(--red);
}

/* SECTION */

.section-title{
    font-size:58px;
    font-weight:800;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.section-text{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-size:24px;
    line-height:1.5;
    margin-bottom:40px;
}

/* KPI */

.kpis{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:20px;
}

.card{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--panel-border);
    border-radius:22px;
    padding:24px;
    position:relative;
}

.card::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:0;
    top:0;
    bottom:0;
    width:6px;
    border-radius:20px 0 0 20px;
    background:var(--red);
}

.card.orange::before{
    background:var(--orange);
}

.card.purple::before{
    background:var(--purple);
}

.card-label{
    color:var(--muted);
    font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.1em;
}

.card-value{
    font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;
    font-size:64px;
    margin-top:10px;
}

.card-desc{
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-top:10px;
    line-height:1.4;
}

/* CONTENT GRID */

.content{
    margin-top:25px;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:24px;
}

.panel{
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--panel-border);
    border-radius:24px;
    padding:24px;
}

.panel h3{
    font-size:34px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

.panel p{
    color:var(--muted);
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.chart{
    height:500px;
    border-radius:14px;
    border:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    color:#7487a5;
}

.footer-stat{
    margin-top:30px;
    background:#16294a;
    border-radius:24px;
    padding:40px;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    align-items:center;
}

.footer-stat h2{
    font-size:48px;
}

.price{
    color:var(--orange);
    font-family:"JetBrains Mono",monospace;
    font-size:72px;
    font-weight:700;
}

@media(max-width:1200px){

.kpis{
grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
}

.content{
grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

h1{
font-size:48px;
}

.section-title{
font-size:42px;
}

}

</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

<div class="hero">

<div>
<h1>HORMUZ <span>SHOCK</span></h1>

<div class="subtitle">
The strait normally carries about a fifth of the world's oil and LNG.
Since the conflict escalation it has been almost shut.
</div>
</div>

<div class="status">
<div class="status-title">
<span class="status-dot"></span>
STATUS: SEVERELY RESTRICTED
</div>
<div style="margin-top:10px;color:#9aa8c7;">
Day 257 • data as of 11 Nov 2026
</div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="timeline">

<div class="timeline-line"></div>

<div class="event" style="left:5%">
<div class="dot red"></div>
War begins
</div>

<div class="event" style="left:18%">
<div class="dot cyan"></div>
Ceasefire
</div>

<div class="event" style="left:33%">
<div class="dot cyan"></div>
US–Iran MOU
</div>

<div class="event" style="left:52%">
<div class="dot red"></div>
Closure declared
</div>

<div class="event" style="left:60%">
<div class="dot orange"></div>
LNG tanker struck
</div>

<div class="event" style="left:94%">
<div class="dot red"></div>
Mines
</div>

</div>

<div class="tabs">
<div class="tab">🛢 Oil prices</div>
<div class="tab active">🚢 Shipping & insurance</div>
<div class="tab">🔥 Gas & LNG</div>
<div class="tab">📰 Inflation & households</div>
</div>

<div class="section-title">
Shipping: traffic collapses, risk gets priced in
</div>

<div class="section-text">
Few owners will send ships through. Those that do pay war-risk premiums
worth millions per voyage.
</div>

<div class="kpis">

<div class="card">
<div class="card-label">SHIP TRANSITS PER DAY</div>
<div class="card-value">1.0</div>
<div class="card-desc">vs 85 pre-crisis</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="card-label">TANKER TONNAGE</div>
<div class="card-value">0.1%</div>
<div class="card-desc">of normal</div>
</div>

<div class="card orange">
<div class="card-label">WAR-RISK PREMIUM</div>
<div class="card-value">6%</div>
<div class="card-desc">of hull value</div>
</div>

<div class="card purple">
<div class="card-label">MARITIME INCIDENTS</div>
<div class="card-value">130</div>
<div class="card-desc">reported incidents</div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="content">

<div class="panel">
<h3>Traffic comparison</h3>
<p>85 squares = one normal day of traffic</p>

<div class="chart">
Traffic visualisation
</div>
</div>

<div class="panel">
<h3>War-risk premium</h3>
<p>Reported levels (% of hull value)</p>

<div class="chart">
Chart.js line chart here
</div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="footer-stat">

<h2>What does one transit cost to insure?</h2>

<div class="price">
$3.00m per transit
</div>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
